Sanguis Depsics is the umbrella term for the effects of ingesting [[Divinity/Unknown Entities/The Deep|deepblood]]. Unlike the two other major mutative blood diseases on [[Geography/Althane/index|Althane]][^1], there are no apparent unifying markers of Sanguis Depsics, and yet it is immediately obvious to others when an "afflicted" is seen.

[^1]: [[Phenomena/Althane/Sanguis Noxa|Vampirism]], [[Phenomena/Althane/Sanguis Bestrum|Lycanthropy]]
